lim_{rho->0} [rho^b/((1+rho)^b-1)] * rho^(1-b)  (b=1/3) = 3 (claim: 1/b = 3)
  b=1/2: limit = 2  (1/b = 2)
  b=1/3: limit = 3  (1/b = 3)
  b=2/3: limit = 3/2  (1/b = 3/2)
  b=1/5: limit = 5  (1/b = 5)
  => N* rho^((1-b)/(1-a)) -> b^(-1/(1-a)) as rho->0 (raise the limit to 1/(1-a)).
a=b=1/2: N* - T3a = 0
exact e_g(rho) at h=0 = b*(rho*(rho + 1)**b - (rho + 1)*((rho + 1)**b - 1))/((a - 1)*(rho + 1)*((rho + 1)**b - 1))
  rho->0 limit, (a,b)=(1/2,1/2): -1 ; (2/3,1/3): -2 ; rho->oo (1/2,1/2): 0

